      "body": "Rose Merc Limited (BSE:512115) executed a non-binding Letter of Intent to acquire 30% stake in Virtual Gain Technologies Private Limited for approximately INR 150 million on December 8, 2025. A cash consideration of INR 150 million will be paid by Rose Merc Limited. As part of consideration, INR 150 million is paid towards common equity of Virtual Gain Technologies Private Limited.\r\n\r\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, Virtual Gain Technologies Private Limited reported total revenue of INR 9.89 million.\r\n\r\nThe transaction is subject to satisfactory legal, tax and operational due diligence, receipt of all necessary internal, shareholder and regulatory approvals, execution and filing of the amended Memorandum and Articles of Association reflecting the revised shareholding and board struct",
